  message: "NO_MOVE on 2/8 via DEEP bakeoff deep-20260623-134237 cohort-001 iter-004 (8 repos, code e5a019c2): apollo (4k={incrementalDelivery iface} ⊄ 16k={requestPipeline iface}) and pretix (4k={PaymentViewSet} ⊄ 16k={LocaleMiddleware}) violate containment monotonicity; the other 6 repos are monotonic. ROOT CAUSE (pretix agent): compact embeds FULL ~23-field node objects, so at 4k/16k only ONE large symbol fits and the top-ranked single symbol differs across budgets → non-monotonic. Pre-existing (iter-3 also violated) — NOT a regression from this session. Fix is the same as the new compact-representation item. Keeping tag until the degenerate-budget case is monotonic."  # d889
